{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired of the same old routine? Craving a dose of adrenaline?</strong><br>Welcome to <strong>Cop Rush</strong> \u2013 the game where your pulse races as fast as your getaway car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this high-octane arcade adventure, you take on the role of a daring outlaw with one simple goal: steal as much money as possible and disappear before the cops catch up. Whether it\u2019s parking lots, icy streets, or busy city roads, there\u2019s always a chance to make a quick grab \u2014 and an even quicker escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy. Police patrols are hot on your trail, and one wrong turn could mean game over. You\u2019ll need sharp reflexes, cool nerves, and a taste for chaos to outsmart the law. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the next Al Pacino-level legend of the streets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Unique Environments: <i>Parking Run, City Run, Winter Run</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Fast Cars + 2 Agile Motorcycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Money Robbery Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase-and-escape action with real-time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the pedal to the metal \u2014 it\u2019s time to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want it more humorous, cinematic, or gritty?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728810?t=1767083441","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728810/35460ce80a1535f1f53528a09354b8a7030692e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767083441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728810/0ce517f788d91c2473f2f7e2643e03bc358